The following files are C++ ports of MATLAB sources from that project:

  include/tcmorph/generalized_tc_morphing.hpp
      port of src/generalizedTCmorphing.m

  include/tcmorph/word_tv2w_morphing.hpp
      port of src/wordTV2WmorphingEngineRev.m

The ports reproduce the numerical behaviour of the originals, including
several known defects, which are retained by default so that results can be
compared against the MATLAB implementation. Deviations from the originals are
documented in docs/porting-notes.md.

The WORLD vocoder itself is not included in this project.
